# Check out text files with LF line endings on every OS. Tests read repository
# files (docs, the changelog, fixtures) and match multi-line text, and
# Git for Windows' default core.autocrlf=true would otherwise turn every LF
# into CRLF in the working tree (#950).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fuzz seeds are raw octets: never convert line endings or diff them as text.
/crates/*/fuzz/seeds/** binary
